{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:19 2026-06-08 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:19 2026-06-08 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:19 2026-06-08 HKT</p><img alt=\"客貨車失控剷上行人路。fb：To Kwa Wan 土瓜灣之友\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f7efeaf06f9fdb4147f77126c43c5b0d/2026-06/8788.jpg\"/><p>今（8日）晨10時許，一輛客貨車沿土瓜灣貴州街行駛，馳至安慶大廈對開時，客貨車失控剷上行人路，兩名途人走避不及受傷，其中一姓魏（71歲）男子後腦流血及下身受傷，另一姓葉（67歲）女子手腳受傷，一併送院治理。據了解，肇事客貨車從美景街右轉入貴州街時失控，剷上行人路直撼安慶大廈門口。警方調查後，姓吳（63歲）司機涉嫌危險駕駛引致他人身體受嚴重傷害被捕。</p><img alt=\"現場遺下血漬及包紮的物品。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e23abb90d8e57e482685fedc1cd1cc1/2026-06/01_3.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場遺下血漬及包紮的物品。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46789757c68b09887db2f8dbfb673c97/2026-06/02_2.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"安慶大廈門口雲石崩裂。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56229b1eac33c123e4254bc99c34dd24/2026-06/03_4.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"肇事客貨車被移走。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e7e345f9ec6e0b181670605f7fffca34/2026-06/04_3.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"男傷者送院治理。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c912bce7443b073c6455f88e9a090b85/2026-06/11_0_16.jpg\"/><img alt=\"傷者送院治理。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a2e3473f747e3996f299a93ff5e937b/2026-06/12_1_8.jpg\"/><img alt=\"女傷者獲送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a9e4f29888708a54f194bcc1506dffce/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-08_at_11_32_38.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70fefb19b215441a16f9567b8524ffd8/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-08_at_11_32_37_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"女傷者由救護車送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f6d2cb51bc91747edd676ab2f350d0a/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-08_at_11_32_37.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b9b72ff304fd7f79e699d2a970d951a/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-08_at_11_32_36.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"客貨車失控剷上行人路。fb：To Kwa Wan 土瓜灣之友\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/844ce596790ee75a6b83870c077d0074/2026-06/21_10.jpg\"/><img alt=\"客貨車失控剷上行人路。fb：To Kwa Wan 土瓜灣之友\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/06e47771770f505a02cd120f6a729d84/2026-06/22_8.jpg\"/><img alt=\"客貨車失控剷上行人路。fb：To Kwa Wan 土瓜灣之友\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a4709d9714e44bd8d7d99cb4ef51a010/2026-06/23_7.jpg\"/><img alt=\"客貨車失控剷上行人路。fb：To Kwa Wan 土瓜灣之友\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3976f56d31dfd154f61fb320480d3348/2026-06/01_1_20.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場大批救援人員。fb：土瓜灣之友\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b201642d4ec670a938d76017c3098ecb/2026-06/02_2_22.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-08T06:23:16.308190+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":16,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}